<title>HONG KONG: HK land auction-Tuen Mun site goes for HK$258 mln.</title>
<headline>HK land auction-Tuen Mun site goes for HK$258 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 5,080-square-metre site in Tuen Mun in the New Territories sold for HK$258 million at a Hong Kong government land auction on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Property consultants had expected the plot for residential usage to fetch between HK$178 million and HK$200 million. -- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
